    "title": "Philadelphia jobs roundup: retail, automotive, food service, and store leadership openings",
    "text": "21 hours ago Philadelphia job seekers will find five very different retail and service openings in this roundup. Spar Group is seeking a traveling lead merchandiser for store resets and fixture work, while Avis Budget Group is hiring a full-time customer return representative for airport vehicle check-ins. In automotive service, Mavis Tire Supply has full-time assistant and service manager roles. Sodexo is looking for a food general manager at Chobani, and Journeys needs a store manager for teen footwear and apparel retail. The mix includes both hands-on customer-facing work and higher-level leadership roles.\nTraveling Lead Merchandiser\nSpar Group · 4d ago\nPhiladelphia, PA\nPart Time Customer Return Representative - FT\nAvis Budget Group · 5d ago\nPhiladelphia, PA\nFull Time\n$15/hr Ma PEP BOYS – Automotive Assistant & Service Managers\nMavis Tire Supply · 8d ago\nPhiladelphia, PA\nFull Time General Manager 1 - Food\nSodexo · 8d ago\nPhiladelphia, PA\nFull Time\n$28.24-$36.54/hr Store Manager\nJourneys · 9d ago\nPhiladelphia, PA\nFull Time More Jobs Nearby View All Registered Nurse Search",
